& [IR1FinalSliceSurfaceV1] is the executable final-slice surface for IR1 implementation substrate and repository scaffold
  + [chunk_ref] is IR1 implementation substrate and repository scaffold
  + [chunk_boundary] is repository/tooling/substrate decisions and scaffold activation only
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/Post_FSC5_Implementation_Readiness_Surface.v1.sop
