  + [current_ready_slice] is IR1-S01
  + [gated_slice_set] is IR1-S02, IR1-S03, IR1-S04, IR1-S05, and IR1-S06
  + [safety_limit] is no live operations control authorized

  = must: execute IR1-S01 before any other IR1 slice
  = must: run completed-work review after each slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts the current slice assumptions
  = must: reject any output that implements parser behavior, SQLite projection building, LangGraph runtime behavior, UI surfaces, adapters, operations simulation, operations control, or live machine control outside the explicit bounded scaffold scope

